## 🎯 Learning Objectives

This project demonstrates:

```text
Spring Security
      +
Custom Security Filter
      +
UserPrincipal
      +
SecurityContext
      +
Bucket4j
      +
Token Bucket
      +
ConcurrentHashMap
      +
Spring Data JPA
      +
H2
```

The main goal is to understand how **application-level rate limiting can be implemented using Spring Security filters and Bucket4j**.

